---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 12, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Terms of Service — Solace"
	description="The terms for using Solace, a free, open-source food scanner and diary app for iOS."
	path="/terms"
>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
		<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-400">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>

		<div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-neutral-300">
			<p>
				By downloading or using Solace, you agree to these terms. Solace is provided free of
				charge, with no purchases or subscriptions of any kind.
			</p>

			<div>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-white">Not medical advice</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
					Solace's scores, badges, allergen checks, and AI-generated explanations are
					informational only and are not medical, dietary, or health advice. A clean safety
					check means "no conflicts found against the exclusions you configured" — it is not a
					guarantee of safety. Nutrition estimates from photos carry meaningful error margins.
					Always consult a qualified professional for medical or dietary decisions, especially
					for serious allergies.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-white">Third-party data</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
					Product and nutrition data comes from Open Food Facts and USDA FoodData Central, both
					external, crowd-sourced or government-maintained sources. Open Food Facts data is used
					under the <a href="https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/" class="text-emerald-400 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-300">Open Database License (ODbL)</a>;
					USDA FoodData Central data is US public domain. Solace does not guarantee
					the accuracy or completeness of this data.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-white">Open source</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
					Solace's source code is publicly available on <a href="https://github.com/nandan-varma/Solace" class="text-emerald-400 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-300">GitHub</a>.
					Refer to the repository for license terms governing use of the source code itself.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-white">No warranty</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
					Solace is provided "as is," without warranty of any kind. To the fullest extent
					permitted by law, the developer is not liable for any damages arising from use of the
					app, including reliance on any score, badge, or AI-generated content it produces.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-white">Changes</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
					These terms may be updated from time to time. Continued use of Solace after a change
					means you accept the revised terms.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-white">Contact</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
					Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:contact@nandan.fyi" class="text-emerald-400 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-emerald-300">contact@nandan.fyi</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
